  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amatura Produce Marketing Enterprise Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Cassava and Maize.Beneficiaries: 124 small holder framers of whom 65 are women..The project funds will be used to provide cassava production inputs, promoting wide adoption of good agricultural practices (GAPs), and improving post-harvest handling of produce. Funds will also be used enhance bulking of produce, value addition though processing and increasing farmer access to profitable markets..</narrative>
  </description>
